<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>KhaozEngine.Particles.Render3D</PackageId>
    <Version>$(KhaozEngineVersion)</Version>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <Description>The 3D arm of the KhaozEngine particle system: turn-key glue between the render-free KhaozEngine.Particles simulation and Render3D's modern particle pass. Scene3D extension methods (DrawParticles, DrawEffect) map a ParticleSystem / ParticleEffectPlayer through a per-emitter ParticleLook to DrawParticle, DrawTrail and budgeted AddLight, and ship a modern VFX preset library (FireBurst, FrostShatter, HealMotes, EmberDrift, SparkShower, Shockwave, SmokePlume, ArcaneSparkle). Kept separate from KhaozEngine.Particles so a headless server or 2D game never drags in Render3D. Presentation only, holds no sim state. MonoGame-free.</Description>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="../KhaozEngine.Particles/KhaozEngine.Particles.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="../KhaozEngine.Render3D/KhaozEngine.Render3D.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="KhaozEngine.Tests" />
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
